    <span class="stage-badge">Loop 01</span>
    <h3>Reading <span class="accent">raw sequence</span></h3>
    <p>
                                Every region is read for what it can hold. The
                                system finds the sites a natural compound can
                                reach on its own — and the ones that require
                                a covalent bond to stay anchored.
                            </p>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Scan</strong> the genome for what can be targeted</li>
      <li><strong>Read</strong> each site — reversible or covalent</li>
      <li><strong>Mark</strong> what a natural compound can hold on its own</li>
      <li><strong>Flag</strong> what only a refined molecule could reach</li>
    </ul>
